t-specific promises, no return-guarantees, disclaimers on instrument commentary violations. (12) DIY design that looks unprofessional."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long should a LinkedIn profile optimization take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For a banking professional, first-pass optimization takes 2-4 weeks: Week 1 — About Us + headline rewrite via voice-capture; Week 2 — banner design + featured section curation + Skills + Certifications update; Week 3 — recommendation requests + engagement + first published content; Week 4 — LinkedIn Newsletter setup + Creator Mode + activity feed refresh. Ongoing optimization: quarterly review of headline + About Us + Featured section + Skills endorsements. ITD handles all this as part of Starter package onboarding."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Should we hire ITD for LinkedIn profile optimization or DIY?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"DIY works if you have 20-40 hours to invest in voice-capture, writing, design, banner creation, ongoing optimization — plus industry-specific compliance knowledge. For most Relationship Manager, Wealth Manager, Investment Banker, Private Banker, Fund Manager, PE/VC Associate + Principal, Fintech Founder, opportunity cost of DIY (senior professional time) exceeds ITD's Rs 30,000/mo Starter package by 3-5x. ITD's approach: 60-min voice-capture interview → we draft your profile in 5-7 business days → you review + approve → we publish. Faster + industry-native + ongoing optimization included. See service page for full details."}}]}</script>
